  "description": "Engineered for the modern pioneer， the Nova Mini redefines urban exploration by merging breathtaking power with remarkable range. Designed for commuters and adventurers alike, it’s your all-access pass to the city and beyond.\n\nUnleash the formidable 3500W peak motor for thrilling acceleration and a top speed of 38 mph, conquering steep hills and traffic with ease. Explore further, with a confidence-inspiring range of up to 60 miles on a single charge from the high-capacity 48V 23Ah battery.\n\nBuilt to dominate diverse terrain, the robust 14x3.0'' 12x3.0'' tires provide agile stability across urban asphalt. With a solid 265 lbs payload capacity, the Nova Mini is ready for any mission.\n\nMerging raw power with enduring range and agile design, the Nova Mini is built for those who demand absolute freedom and pulse-quickening performance on every ride.",
